{"id":"evt-002-0183","type":"communication","subtype":"family_update","subject":"patient_002","encounter_id":"enc-002-001","effective_at":"2026-04-20T10:30:00-05:00","recorded_at":"2026-04-20T10:45:00-05:00","author":{"id":"icu_rn_day","role":"rn"},"source":{"kind":"nurse_charted","ref":"family_update_note"},"certainty":"high","status":"final","data":{"recipient":"husband (HCP)","mode":"in person at bedside","summary":"Provided morning update to husband. He arrived at 09:00 and was at bedside through morning rounds. Reviewed overnight events: lactate continued to clear (1.4), urine output improving (now 50 mL/hr), pressor coming down (norepi 0.04 -> 0.03 throughout AM). Pneumonia treatment continues; vancomycin trough sent. Sedation lightening, RASS -2 with appropriate response to verbal stimulation. Discussed plan for awakening and breathing trial tomorrow if continued improvement. Husband expressed relief at trajectory and asked good questions about extubation criteria. Confirmed code status full, no changes from yesterday.","note_ref":"simulation/live_expected/reference_payload/timeline/2026-04-20/notes/1030_family_update.md"},"links":{}}
